      "text": "I am the light which shineth in darkness, D&C 6:21. life and light of the world, your Redeemer, D&C 10:70. my Spirit, which shall enlighten your mind, D&C 11:13. Jesus Christ … a light which cannot be hid in darkness, D&C 14:9. Spirit giveth light to every man, D&C 84:46. This is the light of Christ, D&C 88:7. light proceedeth forth from the presence of God, D&C 88:12. I am the true light that is in you, D&C 88:50. I am the true light that lighteth every man, D&C 93:2. light and the Redeemer of the world, D&C 93:9.",
